    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101715" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφοδρ-ύνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make vehement, intensify</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.355
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>in Harm.</u>
				p.238W.
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be</i> or <i>become so</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφοδρύνει γ᾽ ἀσθενεῖ σοφίσματι</span>
			<i>thou puttest overweening trust in . . </i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				1011
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποιότητες σφοδρυνόμεναι</span>,
			opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαραινόμεναι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.732c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόσοι οὐκ ἄγαν σφοδρυνθεῖσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					19.563
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				17(1).207
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόνος</span> (pain) 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφοδρυνόμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					2.21
				</span></i>
			: also in aor.
			
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				4.25
			</span></i>. </div>
